{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07693","headline":"宴包二融宅 · 孟浩然","name":"宴包二融宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲居枕清洛，左右接大野。\n门庭无杂宾，车辙多长者。\n是时方盛夏，风物自潇洒。\n五日休沐归，相携竹林下。\n开襟成欢趣，对酒不能罢。\n烟暝栖鸟迷，余将归白社。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}